{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;MESS&quot;</strong> is a multiplayer first-person jailbreak game where strategy, deception, and survival collide in a prison environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of either a <strong>Warden</strong> or a <strong>Prisoner</strong>. As Wardens, your team must maintain order, ensuring prisoners survive until their scheduled executions. Manage their needs, from hunger and health to mental challenges like asthma, diabetes, and outbreaks of disease. Use your tools wisely\u2014batons, tasers, handcuffs, and the emergency button\u2014to keep the chaos at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/extras/electropanel_gif.gif?t=1748674425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prisoners, on the other hand, have one goal: escape. They\u2019ll need to disrupt systems, find opportunities, and avoid the Wardens to make their break for freedom. Mistakes can mean being caught or left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/extras/computer_gif.gif?t=1748674425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Wardens managing the prison and prisoners focused on breaking out, each match is a tense back-and-forth of planning and decisions. The balance between order and escape makes every session tough to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/extras/gym_gif.gif?t=1748674425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the game base mechanics through a tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have access to multiplayer lobbies with other players playing the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a prisoner and try to escape from the prison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a warden and maintain the order</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510550?t=1748674425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510550?t=1748674425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/0a3800f78223f19365abc0f15f699aad237ace5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748674425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/0a3800f78223f19365abc0f15f699aad237ace5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748674425","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;MESS&quot;</strong> is a multiplayer first-person jailbreak game where strategy, deception, and survival collide in a prison environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of either a <strong>Warden</strong> or a <strong>Prisoner</strong>. As Wardens, your team must maintain order, ensuring prisoners survive until their scheduled executions. Manage their needs, from hunger and health to mental challenges like asthma, diabetes, and outbreaks of disease. Use your tools wisely\u2014batons, tasers, handcuffs, and the emergency button\u2014to keep the chaos at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/extras/electropanel_gif.gif?t=1748674425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prisoners, on the other hand, have one goal: escape. They\u2019ll need to disrupt systems, find opportunities, and avoid the Wardens to make their break for freedom. Mistakes can mean being caught or left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/extras/computer_gif.gif?t=1748674425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Wardens managing the prison and prisoners focused on breaking out, each match is a tense back-and-forth of planning and decisions. The balance between order and escape makes every session tough to manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/extras/gym_gif.gif?t=1748674425\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn the game base mechanics through a tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have access to multiplayer lobbies with other players playing the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a prisoner and try to escape from the prison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a warden and maintain the order</p></li></ul>","developers":["Frostveil Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3330050","name":"MESS"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510550/9d15fd4b58f78e4ee0b1eed114325d9d3edd7865/header.jpg?t=1748674425","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147917,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147917/movie480.mp4?t=1748668241","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147917/movie